  "problem": "What is the value of $5 \\div \\dfrac{1}{15} ?$",
  "worked_solution": "To divide a whole number by a unit fraction, we multiply the whole number by the fraction's denominator:\n\n$$\n5 \\div \\dfrac{1}{15} = 5 \\times 15 = 75\n$$",
